                        <locus target="#14v">-14v</locus>فَسَتَعْلَمُوْنَ مَنْ اَصْحَبُ الصِّرَاطِ السَوِيّ وَمَنِ اهْتَدَىْ</explicit>
                     <note>18:75-20:135. The stroke of zayn-s turns right making a 90% angle, and the diacritic is placed at various places. Often words completed on the following line. Red verse markers. Some catchwords, written by a casual hand later than the matn.</note>
